=== str-interp-hash-angle
from: Backtrace::AsHTML 0.0.1 lib/Backtrace/AsHTML.pm6:41
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: node InterpStr
--- code
my %opt = style => 'pre { color: red }', title => 'Oops';
my $out = '';
$out ~= sprintf '<style type="text/css">%s</style>', %opt<style>;
$out ~= "<title>{%opt<title>}</title>";
say $out;
say "%opt{'title'} and %opt<style>.chars()";
say "%opt<title></title>";   # a second <...> subscript: Str is not Associative
--- expect
<style type="text/css">pre { color: red }</style><title>Oops</title>
Oops and 18
!! X::AdHoc

