=== str-repeat-compare-zeros
from: Git::Blame::File 0.0.11 lib/Git/Blame/File.rakumod:46
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix x
--- code
my class Line {
    has $.sha1;
    method committed() { $!sha1 ne '0' x 40 }
}
