=== str-leg-sort-fallback
from: BDD::Behave 0.9.5 lib/BDD/Behave/Parallel/Distribution.rakumod:188
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix leg
--- code
my class Spec { has $.weight; has $.id }
my @specs = Spec.new(:3weight, :id<b>), Spec.new(:5weight, :id<a>), Spec.new(:3weight, :id<a>);
say @specs.sort({ $^b.weight <=> $^a.weight
    || $^a.id leg $^b.id }).map({ "{.id}{.weight}" });
say 'a' leg 'B', ' ', '10' leg '9', ' ', 10 cmp 9;
--- expect
(a5 a3 b3)
More Less More

